This will help you to build a custom Grid World for Machine Learning and it is the perfect way to 
understand the core math of Reinforcement Learning. 
We will build the environment from scratch. 
We are going to USE 5x3 Grid 3 Rows and 5 Columns where the agent is Located at (0,0) the target is (4,0) and Wall are in (2,0),(2,1) and (3,0).
Here Using Q Learning and Reporting Code to Generate report of it location and reward.
